{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17428","headline":"故司徒兼侍中赠太傅北平王挽词 · 权德舆","name":"故司徒兼侍中赠太傅北平王挽词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"授律勳庸盛，居中鼎鼐和。\n佐时调四气，尽力净三河。\n忽访天京兆，空传汉伏波。\n今朝麟阁上，偏轸圣情多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}